  "details": "With EAC I no longer have the ability to optimize or add optimization settings to the game. Without these features it has left the entire game ineffective and dysfunctional for me and plenty other users. EAC also doesn't prevent crashers 80% of the time, but mods on the other hand have been made to prevent crashers. Adding EAC is a like a band-aid put onto a splinter, you need to remove it instead of covering it. It falls off in a week and is soon entirely ineffective. There needs to be better use of coding and the community's input to solve the problem",
